abstract: >-
  xenium-preprocess is step 1 of the Xenium spatial-data preprocessing
  pipeline. It takes a proseg output directory and produces four
  deliverables: (1) raw proseg AnnData, (2) preprocessed unpurified
  AnnData with Leiden clustering and inferred celltype annotations plus
  UMAP plots, (3) a raw-count 10x-style mtx/features/barcodes triple for
  SPLIT downstream analyses, and (4) an RDS "test object" for the RCTD
  spacexr deconvolution workflow. Adapted from an internal SPLIT/Proseg
  workflow.
